From ddc0bf7bf8941daeebeb964a5bb4a99c29fdf5f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Gulya <ilya@gulya.me>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 19:06:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] darlingserver: land the process-management plane and
 descriptor courier (product subset)

Whole-component port of the transport subsystem that the recorded acceptance was measured on.
Source: the frozen scratch product tree; base: the arch profile tip plus the timer fix.
Diagnostic overlay excluded (already canonical on debugger-inbound).

Surface: 46 files changed, 0 patch rejects. The 11 product translation units compile
syntax-clean against the real build flags and generated headers from the existing build
tree, and the duct-tape changes are headers only, validated through those units.

NOT yet done, and deliberately not claimed: a full build of the superproject, deployment
and the acceptance gates. See dar-ssr1 for the state and the next steps.
